{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_2001_p", "source_sha256": "99b287ec40372f82c4ba3d69ed6dc080e6cf8fe50538c4739d6830b0a10cbc62", "ja": "（今日は遊園地のCM撮影……最後は、マスコットの\n『コムギちゃん』との撮影で終わりだ）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄游乐园的广告……最后和吉祥物\n『小麦麦』一起拍摄后就结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_2002_p", "source_sha256": "3734238cce16c700c700108abc583204ff1fe23cfd71c8df493b1edcb0dba332", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香。ずいぶんはしゃいでたな。\n楽しそうでよかったと思うぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。我看你挺兴奋的啊。\n你好像很开心，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_2003_015siz", "source_sha256": "67db4800e5387e3cf66a49977cdfaaca940cccb1874030875fa70a4f980b192b", "ja": "なっ……は、はしゃいでなんかいませんっ！\nあれは、仕事だから笑顔だっただけで……。", "zh": "什……我、我才没有兴奋！\n我摆出笑容，只是因为工作需要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_2004_p", "source_sha256": "84d8365f185a72a526398432efe8b6786d0c40ab2534391b8b3603fcc04e9e8b", "ja": "そうなのか？　でも……\nあ、後ろでコムギちゃんが、手を振ってくれてるぞ。", "zh": "是这样子吗？不过……\n啊，小麦麦在后面对你挥手喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_2005_015siz", "source_sha256": "726d27169a5e1ca6034f32904e9787bdd4487a87268b7e532bc72395a30ec757", "ja": "えっ！？　あっ、本当だ……。\nありがとう、コムギちゃん！　またね！", "zh": "咦！？啊，是真的……\n谢谢你，小麦麦！再见啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_2006_015siz", "source_sha256": "98a51146fda8f6b8f9ed3e2ddbd24d06c129a4e848d2de55964d9a09e479408e", "ja": "な、何ですか？　{$P$}。\n何がそんなにおかしいんですかっ！　もうっ……！", "zh": "怎、怎么了吗？{$P$}。\n有什么好笑的吗！真是的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
